---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalSection from "@/components/organisms/LegalSection.astro";
import TextLink from "@/components/atoms/TextLink.astro";
import PageIntro from "@/components/molecules/PageIntro.astro";

const email = "wavival.dev@luminaw.co";

const pageTitle = "Privacy policy | Valentina Ramírez";
const pageDescription =
  "How wavival.dev handles your data: stored quote requests, analytics, cookies, third-party services, retention, and your rights.";

const lastUpdate = "November 8, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  contactBand={false}
  lang="en"
  alternates={[
    { hreflang: "es", href: "https://www.wavival.dev/privacidad/" },
    { hreflang: "en", href: "https://www.wavival.dev/en/privacy/" },
    { hreflang: "x-default", href: "https://www.wavival.dev/privacidad/" },
  ]}
>
  <section class="wrap page-top">
    <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal">
      <Fragment slot="title">Privacy policy</Fragment>
      <p class="m-0 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdate}</p>
    </PageIntro>

    <div class="mt-16 border-t border-ink">
      <LegalSection index="01" title="Controller">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          This site (wavival.dev) is the personal portfolio of Valentina Ramírez, software developer
          and founder of Lúmina W. For any matter regarding your data, write to
          <TextLink variant="inline" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</TextLink>.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
      <LegalSection index="02" title="What data I collect">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          When you send a quote request, I collect your name, email, phone with country code,
          business name, services of interest, country, budget range and the currency you stated it
          in, the project description and, if you fill them in, how you found me, your preferred
          contact channel and when you need it. I also keep the page language, the browser you sent
          the form from (user agent), the page you came from, and the date and time of your consent.
        </p>
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          That data is stored in a database (Supabase, us-east-1 region, United States) to follow up
          on your request, and it is emailed to Wavival so I can reply. I use it only to answer and
          follow up on your quote request.
        </p>
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          The country of the visit is derived from the IP address without storing the address: only
          the country code is kept. To limit abuse of the form, the server counts submissions per IP
          address for at most 10 minutes, only in its temporary memory. That address is not stored
          or shared, and it is not part of your quote data.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
      <LegalSection index="03" title="Analytics and cookies">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          If analytics are enabled, I use Umami: a cookieless, privacy-focused tool. It measures, in
          aggregate and anonymous form, how the site is used (page views, country, device type,
          where the visit comes from). It sets no cookies, does not track across sites, and does not
          identify individuals; nor is data shared for advertising purposes.
        </p>
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          Since no tracking cookies are used, this site does not need a consent banner.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
      <LegalSection index="04" title="Third-party services">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          Quote requests are stored in Supabase (a database hosted in the United States) and sent
          through Brevo to the Wavival email address. Each one processes the data needed to store or
          deliver that message. On the contact page, the site loads the Calendly calendar. These
          services may record your IP simply by serving the resource. Typefaces are served from the
          site itself (no third party). Hosting is provided by Vercel, which maintains standard
          server technical logs. Each provider handles that data under their own policy.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
      <LegalSection index="05" title="Retention">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          If we do not end up working together, I keep your quote data for 24 months from the last
          contact and then delete it. To have it deleted earlier, write to
          <TextLink variant="inline" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</TextLink> from the email you used
          in the quote request and I will delete it.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
      <LegalSection index="06" title="Your rights">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          Under applicable regulations including GDPR and Colombia's Ley 1581 de 2012 (Habeas Data),
          you have the right to access, rectify, erase, and restrict processing of your personal
          data, and to withdraw any consent. To exercise these rights or ask about a quote request,
          write to <TextLink variant="inline" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</TextLink>.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
      <LegalSection index="07" title="Changes">
        <p class="body-md m-0">
          If this policy changes, I will update the date above. Continued use of the site implies
          acceptance of the current version.
        </p>
      </LegalSection>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 mt-8 text-[15px] text-muted">
      Contact: <a class="inline-link" href="mailto:wavival.dev@luminaw.co">wavival.dev@luminaw.co</a
      >
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
